WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:04.040
Report the Wuzhao are forcing refugees to attack the city what did you say?

00:04.120 --> 00:06.453
They're forcing refugees to attack the city.

00:23.120 --> 00:27.120
Hurry, come with me faster I beg you.

00:27.200 --> 00:30.200
I don't want to die, let me go back.

00:34.320 --> 00:35.720
Move forward.

00:36.680 --> 00:39.347
Set the ladders against the walls to survive.

00:45.640 --> 00:47.160
Archers, take position.

01:03.160 --> 01:08.520
This please don't mind I am Prince of Jin Sikong Yao of Great Xuan.

01:08.600 --> 01:14.520
I promise you all the royal army will surely recover our homeland and restore for everyone.

01:14.600 --> 01:16.000
A peaceful world.

01:24.640 --> 01:28.560
Your Highness the enemy has entered firing range.

